  destinations:
  - destinationName: Jungle Entrance
    description: 'Step beyond the ancient trees into a vibrant tropical paradise.

      Nature
      surrounds you with colorful plants and exotic wildlife.

      Every trail
      leads deeper into the jungle''s hidden mysteries.

      Adventure begins the
      moment you enter.'
    background: {fileID: -7650948393612011259, guid: f892bd6ae28634115b2b0c8f85a8b0df, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Waterfall
    description: 'Crystal-clear water cascades through lush tropical cliffs.

      Mist
      cools the air while birds sing high above the trees.

      Hidden caves and
      secret pathways wait beyond the flowing water.

      Nature''s beauty shines
      at every turn.'
    background: {fileID: -8844290107566611656, guid: 9c53372bdd4494733a865f3f06a7cfc9, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Ancient Temple
    description: 'Deep within the jungle rests a forgotten temple lost to time.

      Ancient
      carvings whisper stories of explorers from long ago.

      Solve challenging
      puzzles to unlock hidden chambers.

      Every discovery reveals another piece
      of history.'
    background: {fileID: 4819329118229324453, guid: 1348655c5f33f4f99b82522bf1e7be0a, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Hanging Vines
    description: 'Massive vines stretch between towering jungle trees overhead.

      Swing
      through lush forests filled with vibrant life.

      Hidden pathways twist
      beneath the leafy canopy.

      Every step uncovers another jungle secret.'
    background: {fileID: 2925679465770131994, guid: 670ce1bfcd50e4a829a6b94e2e48990d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Rainforest
    description: 'Dense rainforest surrounds you with towering trees and colorful
      wildlife.

      Gentle rain keeps the forest alive with endless beauty.

      Explore
      winding trails filled with hidden rewards.

      Every journey brings new
      surprises waiting to be discovered.'
    background: {fileID: 7107476504188617502, guid: ccb6488b468b740f8b8c612b985b64e5, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Giant Tree
    description: 'A colossal tree rises high above the surrounding jungle.

      Its
      massive roots hide forgotten tunnels and mysterious treasures.

      Climb
      higher to discover breathtaking views.

      Every branch leads toward another
      adventure.'
    background: {fileID: 7276910582221583177, guid: 29e80bb542b6a4d8ab419a226a5efae1, type: 3}
